# Keep EVERY canonical skill asset LF-only, not just SKILL.md, so training-certification hashes
# are byte-identical across Windows checkouts and CI (Linux) checkouts. The projection guard is a
# byte-for-byte snapshot equality and core.autocrlf=true rewrites unpinned assets to CRLF on
# Windows: measured 2026-10-26, 23 of 41 skill-source assets here were CRLF on disk (LICENSE
# 1089B/checkout vs 1068B/blob) while every blob is LF. text=auto keeps binary detection.
skill-sources/** text=auto eol=lf
# Projection history is machine-read (JSON.parse) and line-ending agnostic;
# pin LF so future digest appends never produce whole-file churn.
src/clients/projection-history.json text eol=lf
